  "comment": {
    "text": "Hint under the auto-lock selector on the Keys management tab of the profile, which offers 5, 15 and 30 minutes. It says that the two shorter options lock the encryption keys not only after inactivity but also as soon as the browser tab is hidden; the 30 minute option does not. Keys means encryption keys, tab means a browser tab. One short sentence.",
